{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n壽司郎赤醋飯祭! $27吞拿魚二貫盛\n</p>\n<h2>壽司郎限時優惠黑鮪大吞拿魚腩$17！ </h2>\n<p>壽司郎今個月推出大受歡迎嘅「赤醋飯祭」，當中焦點是京都伊根生黑鮪大吞拿魚腩、京都伊根生黑鮪吞拿魚二貫盛、京都伊根生黑鮪吞拿魚蓉海苔包。大吞拿魚腩魚脂油滑，入口鮮香濃郁，加埋山葵莖Wasabi，讓滋味一秒升級！由11月14日起京都伊根生黑鮪嘅3款產品都有限時優惠，大吞拿魚腩優惠價$17就食到了！而吞拿魚二貫盛優惠價$27、吞拿魚蓉海苔包優惠價$12， 鍾情吞拿魚的你，萬勿錯過！</p>\n<h2>11月赤醋飯祭全新新品！</h2>\n<p>今期赤醋飯祭有多款新品，焦點有蟹肉雙味山，水煮松葉蟹爪下棒肉加埋絲絲紅楚蟹肉，搭配香濃三文魚子和蟹膏，蟹鮮十足！仲有南蠻蝦配三文魚子、特大赤貝、脆脆蝦手卷配蟹柳沙律、菇菇羹茶碗蒸等，大家仲要試炸蕃薯條配蜂蜜牛油，條條外層香脆，好邪惡！</p>\n<p>壽司郎<br/>\n備註：【赤醋飯祭】限定商品 11 月 3 日（二）起，於全線分店有售（深水埗西九龍中心店 除外）；【京都伊根生黑鮪吞拿魚】限定商品 11 月 3 日（二）起，於全線分店有售；深水埗西九龍中心店之壽司商品均一律使用常規白醋飯；11月14日起京都伊根生黑鮪3款產品有限時優惠<br/>\n官方IG：@sushiro.hk</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463605384270468_12430561956af7f916456c6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463605384270468_12430561956af7f916456c6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463605567598745_11922707396af7f9181f0a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463605567598745_11922707396af7f9181f0a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463605732820047_8730625526af7f91a03c77.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463605732820047_8730625526af7f91a03c77.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463605961779043_8902894576af7f91c2fd63.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463605961779043_8902894576af7f91c2fd63.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463606235795217_20834885816af7f91f10c6a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463606235795217_20834885816af7f91f10c6a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463606610164716_3047298086af7f924328d7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463606610164716_3047298086af7f924328d7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DftPmEqk4Pj/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:20:50.358869+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":735,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:15:41.237538+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:14:16.090763+00:00","content_hash":"eb1ab7246f01f5bf94dbb423c3c5173767c201bb121c62e37e7103de15f41544","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}